% BAB/L/014, Science Museum Group Collection, document aa110001644.
% The second table of the opened sheet (image 222/571, lower half, running
% across both halves of the sheet). The cover (222/570): "No 13" struck
% through, "14", and "no date" in pencil. Read from the zoom images at full
% resolution. See sources/notes/L014.md.
%
% NOT RUN AS IT STANDS (hence .draft): the table takes its coefficients
% a0 … a4 again and again from columns holding their complements ("Comp a0"),
% and lays "Comp a0" again as it does so; the engine has no rule for a
% complement read into the mill. See the notes.

Sheet BAB/L/014
No. 14.2
Date                      % none on the sheet; the cover has "no date" in pencil
Title "Calculation of the first six coeffecients of the above product. λ0 = A0a0, λ1 = A0a1 + A1a0 ..... λ5 = A0a5 + A1a4 + A2a3 + A3a2 + A4a1 + A5a0"
Image 222/570 cover
Image 222/571 the second table

Letters A0 A1 A2 A3 A4 A5 a0 a1 a2 a3 a4 a5
Find λ0 = A0a0
Find λ1 = A0a1+A1a0
Find λ2 = A0a2+A1a1+A2a0
Find λ3 = A0a3+A1a2+A2a1+A3a0
Find λ4 = A0a4+A1a3+A2a2+A3a1+A4a0
Find λ5 = A0a5+A1a4+A2a3+A3a2+A4a1+A5a0

% The sheet heads v1 to v6 "A0" to "A5", v7 to v12 "a0" to "a5"; v13 to v24
% are headed with their numbers only, and v23, v24 are never used. Four
% unheaded columns stand between v12 and v13. "Comp a0" is written in
% words; here Ca0. The mill column of the additions is in the cover's
% shorthand, i.j for Ai aj; written out here.
Store v1 = A0, v2 = A1, v3 = A2, v4 = A3, v5 = A4, v6 = A5, v7 = a0, v8 = a1, v9 = a2, v10 = a3, v11 = a4, v12 = a5
Working v13 v14 v15 v16 v17 v18 v19 v20 v21 v22

Op 1    ×  | A0a0                               | v1 0, v7 0, v13 =λ0, v14 Ca0 |   % v13 "λ0"; a faint mark in v8
Op 2    ×  | A0a1                               | v1 A0a1, v8 0, v15 Ca1 |
Op 3    ×  | A0a2                               | v7 A0a2, v9 0, v16 Ca2 |
Op 4    ×  | A0a3                               | v8 A0a3, v10 0, v17 Ca3 |   % "Comp a3": the subscript could be read 0
Op 5    ×  | A0a4                               | v9 A0a4, v11 0, v18 Ca4 |
Op 6    ×  | A0a5                               | v10 A0a5, v12 0 |
Op 7    ×  | A1a0                               | v2 0, v11 A1a0, v12 Ca0, v14 0 |   % a 0 struck through in the unheaded column after v12
Op 8    ×  | A1a1                               | v14 A1a1, v15 0, v19 Ca1 |   % an erased figure in v11
Op 9    ×  | A1a2                               | v15 A1a2, v16 0, v20 Ca2 |
Op 10   ×  | A1a3                               | v16 A1a3, v17 0, v21 Ca3 |
Op 11   ×  | A1a4                               | v17 A1a4, v18 0 |
Op 12   +  | A0a1+A1a0                          | v1 0, v11 0, v18 =λ1 |   % "0.1+1.0"
Op 13   ×  | A2a0                               | v1 A2a0, v3 0, v11 Ca0, v12 0 |
Op 14   ×  | A2a1                               | v3 A2a1, v12 Ca1, v19 0 |
Op 15   ×  | A2a2                               | v19 A2a2, v20 0, v22 Ca2 |
Op 16   ×  | A2a3                               | v20 A2a3, v21 0 |
Op 17   +  | A0a2+A1a1                          | v7 0, v14 0, v21 A0a2+A1a1 |   % "0.2+1.1"
Op 18   +  | A0a2+A1a1+A2a0                     | v1 0, v7 =λ2, v21 0 |   % "0.2+2.0"
Op 19   ×  | A3a0                               | v1 A3a0, v4 0, v11 0, v14 Ca0 |
Op 20   ×  | A3a1                               | v4 A3a1, v11 Ca1, v12 0 |
Op 21   ×  | A3a2                               | v12 A3a2, v22 0 |
Op 22   +  | A0a3+A1a2                          | v8 0, v15 0, v21 A0a3+A1a2 |   % "0.3+1.2"
Op 23   +  | A0a3+A1a2+A2a1                     | v3 0, v8 A0a3+A1a2+A2a1, v21 0 |   % "0.3+2.1"
Op 24   +  | A0a3+A1a2+A2a1+A3a0                | v1 0, v3 =λ3, v8 0 |   % "0.3+3.0"
Op 25   ×  | A4a0                               | v1 A4a0, v5 0 |   % no 0 in v14, where Comp a0 stands; the Comp a0 below is written on row 26's line
Op 26   ×  | A4a1                               | v2 Ca0, v5 A4a1, v11 0 |   % "Comp a0" in v2 on this line, though this row multiplies by a1
Op 27   +  | A0a4+A1a3                          | v8 A0a4+A1a3, v9 0, v16 0 |   % "0.4+1.3"
Op 28   +  | A0a4+A1a3+A2a2                     | v8 0, v9 A0a4+A1a3+A2a2, v19 0 |   % "0.4+2.2"; a blot beside v8's 0
Op 29   +  | A0a4+A1a3+A2a2+A3a1                | v4 0, v9 0, v11 A0a4+A1a3+A2a2+A3a1 |   % "0.4+3.1"
Op 30   +  | A0a4+A1a3+A2a2+A3a1+A4a0           | v1 0, v9 =λ4, v11 0 |   % "0.4+4.0"
Op 31   ×  | A5a0                               | v1 A5a0, v2 0, v6 0 |
Op 32   +  | A5a0+A4a1                          | v1 0, v2 A5a0+A4a1, v5 0 |   % "5.0+4.1"
Op 33   +  | A5a0+A4a1+A3a2                     | v1 A5a0+A4a1+A3a2, v2 0, v12 0 |   % "5.0+3.2"
Op 34   +  | A5a0+A4a1+A3a2+A2a3                | v1 0, v2 A5a0+A4a1+A3a2+A2a3, v20 0 |   % "5.0+2.3"
Op 35   +  | A5a0+A4a1+A3a2+A2a3+A1a4           | v1 A5a0+A4a1+A3a2+A2a3+A1a4, v2 0, v17 0 |   % "5.0+1.4"
Op 36   +  | A5a0+A4a1+A3a2+A2a3+A1a4+A0a5      | v1 0, v2 =λ5, v10 0 |   % "5.0+0.5"; "λ5" over a smudged pencil "5.0…", and a faint pencil λ5 above v1
